==English==
[[Image:CraneFly.jpg|thumb|Cranefly.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|crane-fly}}
* {{l|en|crane fly}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|crane|fly}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɹeɪnˌflaɪ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various large [[fly|flies]] of the suborder [[Tipulomorpha]] that have slender bodies and very long legs and that resemble giant [[mosquito]]es.

====Synonyms====
* In ''UK'': [[daddy longlegs]]
* In ''US'': {{vern|gullywhumper}}, {{vern|gollywhopper}}, [[mosquito hawk]]

====Coordinate terms====
* {{l|en|leatherjacket}} {{qf|cranefly larva}}

